@startuml
title Zoom on order follow-up

participant "ProductOrderCapture\nValidation" as POCV
participant "PartyInteractionManagement" as PIM #red
participant "PartyManagement" as PM #red
participant "ProductInventory" as PI
participant "EventManagement" as Event
participant "CommunicationServer" as CS

Event -> POCV : 60 **TMF688 Event Management** POST /listener/TaskFlowStateChange\nstate='Completed',PFSpec='POOM'

alt complete product order delivered
    Event -> POCV : 61 **TMF688 Event Management** POST /listener/ProcessFlowStateChange\nstate='Completed',PFSpec='POOM'
end

POCV -> POCV : 62 Compute order item at product offering level

note right of PI : Update of Product Inventory for product offering level

POCV -> PI : 63 **TMF637 Product Inventory Management** PATCH /product/id1 (Product Offering instance update for state, date, productPrice, etc.)
activate PI
PI --> POCV : 64 **TMF637** 200 OK\nProduct updated
deactivate PI

POCV -> POCV : 65 **TMF622 Product Ordering** PATCH /productOrder/id1\n(stateItem update)\nUpdate Product order item(s) state for product offering level

POCV -> POCV : 66 Compute Product order state\n(Check all commercial activities\ncompletion like document signature)

alt ProductOrder state shifted to completed
    POCV -> POCV : 67 **TMF622 Product Ordering** PATCH /productOrder/id1\n(state update)

    note over POCV, PIM : Order follow-up detects a communication must be sent to customer

    POCV -> PIM : 68 **TMF701 Process Flow** POST /processFlow\n(ProcessFlowSpec=manageCommunication +\nCommunicateOrderDeliveryCompletion+productOrderId\n+party.id)
    activate PIM

    PIM -> PM : 69 **TMF632 Party Management** GET /party/{id}?fields=contactMedium
    PM --> PIM : 70 party contact medium information

    PIM -> PIM : 71 determine prefered customer contact\nor retrieve from order

    PIM -> CS : 72 **TMF681 Communication** POST /communicationMessage\n(receiver method, content)
    activate CS
    CS --> PIM : 73 **TMF681** 201 Created\n(communication sent)
    deactivate CS

    PIM -> PIM : 74 **TMF683 Party Interaction** POST /partyInteraction

    PIM --> POCV : 75 **TMF701** 201 Created\nProcessFlow created
    deactivate PIM

    PIM -> Event : 76 **TMF688 Event Management** POST Event (ProcessFlowStateChange\nstate='Completed',PFSpec='ManageCommunication')

    Event -> POCV : 77 **TMF688 Event Management** POST /listener/ProcessFlowStateChangeEvent\n(state='Completed',PFSpec='ManageCommunication')

    POCV -> Event : 78 **TMF688 Event Management** POST /processFlowStateChangeEvent\n(state='Completed',PFSpec='PrdOrdCptVd')
end

@enduml
